# Frontend Knowledge Base

When answering React / frontend architecture or pattern questions, read the relevant file from the installed KB before answering.

- KB root: `D:\medical\react-knowledge-base`
- Cursor skill: `fe-playbook` (`~/.cursor/skills/fe-playbook`)
- Env: `REACT_KB_PATH` (User) → same path

Start from `AGENTS.md` or `docs/file-map.md` in the KB if unsure which topic file to open.
